ivide the number of gallons, $\\frac{8}{15},$ by the number of seconds, $4$, as follows:   \n\n$$\n\\frac{8}{15}÷4\n$$\n\nDividing a fraction by a whole number is equivalent to multiplying the fraction by the reciprocal of that whole number:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{8}{15}÷4 & =\\frac{8}{15}÷\\frac{4}{1} \\\\  & =\\frac{8}{15}\\times \\frac{1}{4} \\\\  & =\\frac{8\\times 1}{15\\times 4} \\\\  & =\\frac{2\\times 4}{15\\times 4} \\\\  & =\\frac{2\\times \\cancel{4}}{15\\times \\cancel{4}} \\\\  & =\\frac{2}{15}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the unit rate in this situation is $\\frac{2}{15}$ gallons per second."] ["question-bde894c0-0f60-52a1-8f53-44362f2c04ac" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] ["answer-field-3757453c-451a-533e-89bf-ae008505f529" :answer-field/id #uuid "3757453c-451a-533e-89bf-ae008505f529"] ["answer-8ea4677e-c8ef-54b9-a15a-630f36cbe00b" :answer/id #uuid "8ea4677e-c8ef-54b9-a15a-630f36cbe00b"] ["answer-8ea4677e-c8ef-54b9-a15a-630f36cbe00b" :answer/type :answer.type/text] ["answer-8ea4677e-c8ef-54b9-a15a-630f36cbe00b" :answer/value "$\\frac{1}{3}$ gallons per second"] ["answer-8cc41ae4-5ed6-5660-bbbc-4a08a3bf722b" :answer/id #uuid "8cc41ae4-5ed6-5660-bbbc-4a08a3bf722b"] ["answer-8cc41ae4-5ed6-5660-bbbc-4a08a3bf722b" :answer/type :answer.type/text] ["answer-8cc41ae4-5ed6-5660-bbbc-4a08a3bf722b" :answer/value "$\\frac{1}{5}$ gallons per second"] ["answer-cbc7a1c4-f866-5d17-a6b7-c95942a60d35" :answer/id #uuid "cbc7a1c4-f866-5d17-a6b7-c95942a60d35"] ["answer-cbc7a1c4-f866-5d17-a6b7-c95942a60d35" :answer/type :answer.type/text] ["answer-cbc7a1c4-f866-5d17-a6b7-c95942a60d35" :answer/value "$\\frac{2}{15}$ gallons per second"] ["answer-9b42d88b-d93e-501b-b9d6-31e30b995f77" :answer/id #uuid "9b42d88b-d93e-501b-b9d6-31e30b995f77"] ["answer-9b42d88b-d93e-501b-b9d6-31e30b995f77" :answer/type :answer.type/text] ["answer-9b42d88b-d93e-501b-b9d6-31e30b995f77" :answer/value "$\\frac{4}{15}$ gallons per second"] ["answer-8d75af3a-b98d-5d57-aa31-3ac